<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Red Episodes - Boomer to Sea, 1989</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;1989 WWIII&amp;nbsp; Red Episodes&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Boomer to Sea&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;This is the&amp;nbsp;third scenario in a series of little scenarios based on hypothetical WWIII&amp;nbsp; between WP and NATO. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;All these scenarios are small and playable from Soviet side only.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;Author- Miguel Molina 'Meroka37'&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;Note: Run the scenario for at least 1 second before starting to give orders to units.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
